<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:00:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>俄罗斯战机几秒钟内就进入韩国领空，首尔紧急升空 F-15K</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace</link><description>&lt;p&gt;俄罗斯 Tu-160 和护航战斗机​​的出现引发了韩国居民的避难令。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace"&gt;当俄罗斯战机在几秒钟内进入韩国领空时，首尔紧急升空 F-15K 的&lt;/a&gt;报道首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace</guid></item><item><title>FireAnt Mini无人地面车辆在美国陆军测试中部署无人机检测传感器</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/fireant-mini-uncrewed-ground-vehicles-deploy-drone-detection-sensors-in-u-s-army-test</link><description>&lt;p&gt;陆军明确要求将传感器放置在非常敌对的前沿区域，像 FireAnt 这样的小型机器人可能会提供巨大的帮助。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/fireant-mini-uncrewed-ground-vehicles-deploy-drone-detection-sensors-in-u-s-army-test"&gt;FireAnt 迷你无人地面车辆在美国陆军测试中部署无人机检测传感器的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:19:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/fireant-mini-uncrewed-ground-vehicles-deploy-drone-detection-sensors-in-u-s-army-test</guid></item><item><title>瑞典鹰狮在波兰以小足迹做大事</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/swedens-tiny-gripen-fighter-detachment-takes-on-a-big-nato-role</link><description>&lt;p&gt;瑞典正在将其分散的战斗机行动扩展到整个北约，而波兰的一个小型前沿支援部队正在编写剧本。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/swedens-tiny-gripen-fighter-detachment-takes-on-a-big-nato-role"&gt;瑞典鹰狮在波兰以微小的足迹做大事的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:34:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/swedens-tiny-gripen-fighter-detachment-takes-on-a-big-nato-role</guid></item><item><title>土耳其克孜勒马战斗机无人机宣布投入运行</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/turkish-kizilelma-fighter-drone-declared-operational</link><description>&lt;p&gt;巴伊卡很早就加入了“战斗机无人机”阵营，目前多个空军部队正在全球范围内寻求类似的能力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/turkish-kizilelma-fighter-drone-declared-operational"&gt;土耳其克孜勒马战斗机无人机宣布投入运行后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:10:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/turkish-kizilelma-fighter-drone-declared-operational</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰是否使用母舰对班加西的俄罗斯船只发动海上无人机攻击？</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/did-ukraine-use-a-mothership-to-launch-its-sea-drone-attack-on-russian-ships-in-benghazi</link><description>&lt;p&gt;秘密母舰将使乌克兰有能力扩大对远离黑海的俄罗斯航运的攻击。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/did-ukraine-use-a-mothership-to-launch-its-sea-drone-attack-on-russian-ships-in-benghazi"&gt;乌克兰是否使用母舰对班加西的俄罗斯船只发动海上无人机攻击？&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:12:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/did-ukraine-use-a-mothership-to-launch-its-sea-drone-attack-on-russian-ships-in-benghazi</guid></item><item><title>海军陆战队希望射程加倍的海军打击导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/marines-want-naval-strike-missiles-with-double-the-range</link><description>&lt;p&gt;增程 NSM 巡航导弹将使海军陆战队能够在四倍的区域内将战舰和地面目标置于危险之中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/marines-want-naval-strike-missiles-with-double-the-range"&gt;海军陆战队希望射程加倍的海军打击导弹&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:45:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/marines-want-naval-strike-missiles-with-double-the-range</guid></item><item><title>中国海军发展成为珠海航展的焦点</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-naval-developments-set-for-the-spotlight-at-zhuhai-airshow</link><description>&lt;p&gt;即将举行的展览将突出北京对舰载航空、主要水面作战舰艇和新兴无人系统的雄心。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-naval-developments-set-for-the-spotlight-at-zhuhai-airshow"&gt;珠海航展上中国海军发展成为焦点的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:30:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-naval-developments-set-for-the-spotlight-at-zhuhai-airshow</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰针对远离黑海的俄罗斯海军资产的行动进入新阶段（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/ukraines-campaign-against-russian-naval-assets-far-beyond-the-black-sea-enters-a-new-phase</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌克兰在一天内成功摧毁了一艘新的俄罗斯护卫舰，并击中了另外两艘货船，一艘在地中海，一艘在波罗的海。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/ukraines-campaign-against-russian-naval-assets-far-beyond-the-black-sea-enters-a-new-phase"&gt;乌克兰针对远在黑海之外的俄罗斯海军资产的行动进入新阶段（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:26:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/ukraines-campaign-against-russian-naval-assets-far-beyond-the-black-sea-enters-a-new-phase</guid></item><item><title>西奥多·罗斯福号航空母舰抵达中东，接替乔治·华盛顿号航空母舰</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington</link><description>&lt;p&gt;截至 2026 年 11 月 21 日，航空母舰所在位置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington"&gt;西奥多·罗斯福号航空母舰抵达中东，救援乔治·华盛顿号航空母舰&lt;/a&gt;后，首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:11:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington</guid></item><item><title>地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我嘴里有股奇怪的黄铜味，你尝到了吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216"&gt;《地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:12:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216</guid></item></channel></rss>